7. Add or update template/render tests to verify the email confirmation renders the promo discount line for return trips in the same position and format as outbound, omits the line when discount is zero, and produces no error for edge cases (no promo, expired promo, outbound-only promo).

8. Run the full test suite for the affected modules, verify accessibility checks pass for the discount label/amount text, and confirm no regressions in existing Mozio email confirmation rendering.
